{"url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/repos/Tencent/APIJSON/pulls/comments/34809678", "id": 34809678, "path": null, "position": null, "original_position": null, "new_line": null, "commit_id": null, "original_commit_id": null, "user": {"id": 485581, "login": "TommyLemon", "name": "TommyLemon", "avatar_url": "https://foruda.gitee.com/avatar/1676915493729933318/485581_tommylemon_1578925347.jpg", "url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon", "html_url": "https://gitee.com/TommyLemon", "remark": "", "followers_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/followers", "following_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/following_url{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/orgs", "repos_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/repos", "events_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/TommyLemon/received_events", "type": "User"}, "created_at": "2024-11-30T22:44:14+08:00", "updated_at": "2024-11-30T22:44:14+08:00", "body": "华为 GaussDB 基于 PostgreSQL，在 APIJSON 内可以当成 PostgreSQL 用，或者写约 8 行适配代码，参考 @afumu 为 APIJSON 支持 SQLite 的 PR（注意 GaussDB 要在 AbstractSQLConfig 改 getQuote，return \"\\\"\"; 双引号来包裹表名/字段名）：\nhttps://gitee.com/Tencent/APIJSON/commit/8dbdc4f6e2a7470c1b2bb523addf1d37f657b0fa\n![输入图片说明](https://foruda.gitee.com/images/1732977835076716820/fcaf569a_485581.png \"屏幕截图\")", "html_url": "https://gitee.com/Tencent/APIJSON/pulls/8#note_34809678", "pull_request_url": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/repos/Tencent/APIJSON/pulls/8", "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/repos/Tencent/APIJSON/pulls/comments/34809678"}, "html": {"href": "https://gitee.com/Tencent/APIJSON/pulls/8#note_34809678_conversation_134274096"}, "pull_request": {"href": "https://gitee.com/api/v5/repos/Tencent/APIJSON/pulls/8"}}, "comment_type": "pr_comment", "repo": "Tencent/APIJSON", "pr_number": 8}
